<article class="env-lemma" id="033F">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/033F">Lemma <span data-tag="033F">10.164.2</span>.</a> Let $R \to S$ be a ring map. Assume that </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$R \to S$ is faithfully flat, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$S$ is reduced. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> Then $R$ is reduced. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear as $R \to S$ is injective, by Lemma <a href="/tag/05CK" data-tag="05CK">10.82.15</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>